OL,3,GNEWSADriver guilty of causing deaths of
OL,4,Amum and daughter
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver who raced another man who
OL,7,Ffatally struck a mum and her
OL,8,Ffour-year-old daughter has been
OL,9,Fconvicted of causing death by dangerous
OL,10,Fdriving.
OL,12,FJustyna Hulboj, 27, and her daughter
OL,13,FLena Czepczor were killed when they
OL,14,Fwere hit by an Audi TT RS as they
OL,15,Fwalked to the girl's nursery in Leeds
OL,16,Fon 16 January 2023.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
