OL,3,GNEWSADriver guilty of causing deaths of
OL,4,Amum and daughter
OL,5,
OL,6,FJasskamal Riyat, who was driving a BMW1
OL,7,FSeries closely behind when the fatal
OL,8,Fcrash happened, had denied racing the
OL,9,FAudi's driver, Hardeep Bachu, who
OL,10,Fpreviously admitted causing their
OL,11,Fdeaths.
OL,13,FBut a jury convicted the 37-year-old of
OL,14,Fthe same offences on Friday after a
OL,15,Fweek-long trial at Leeds Crown Court.
OL,16,FBoth men will be sentenced on 26
OL,17,FOctober.
